  "a tone is a legibility aid over the palaeo classes, never evidence that the modern country existed",
  "the plate match is by plate id, not by static fragment identity",
  "the tone is evaluated at the interval mid-age, so it does not follow an off-schedule record's own lifecycle inside the interval"
 ],
